{"id":368,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"地域と世界に開かれた東福岡自彊館","feature_description":"東福岡自彊館中学校は、『地域に、社会に、世界に、開かれた学校』を掲げ、自学力と進路保障を軸に学ぶ学校です。ICTで主体的な学びを支え、部活動では人間力や協調性を重視します。生徒主体の学校運営も特徴です。仲間と学び、仲間と動く学校として、自分で考える力を育てます。生徒会や行事への参加も、成長の場として機能しています。自彊館の学びを実感しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6755,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6756,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6757,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6758,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6759,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6760,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6761,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6762,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6763,"name":"ラグビーフットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6764,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6765,"name":"ESC(English Speaking Club)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.higashifukuoka.ed.jp/juniorhighschool/schoollife/club/","verif